	(text "CHARGER TP4054 (top)\nIbat = 1000 V / R3:  3k = 333 mA, 2k = 500 mA.\nKeep Ibat <= 0.5 x cell capacity.\n~CHRG (open drain) -> PB3, internal pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0209d018-1fe6-4cc0-9377-4e7443686b3f")
	)
	(text "ISP POGO PADS (bottom)\nFlash with the battery out or programmer power off.\nMOSI=PB0 MISO=PB1 SCK=PB2: don't press the button while flashing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "19433228-2abb-4bad-9f85-14ac9c12a3dc")
	)
	(text "LED DRIVERS, common anode (top)\nR13 33R, shared (only one LED is on at a time). LEDs measured\n25-35 mA @ ~3.0 V -> ~33 mA at 4.2 V, ~20 mA at 3.7 V, ~12 mA at 3.4 V.\n100k holds each gate low while the MCU resets or is flashed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "514279e8-4a55-43e4-b7ad-efdd85c7a240")
	)
	(text "PROTECTION DW01A + FS8205A (bottom)\nSwitches the minus lead: everything else uses GND (= P-), never BAT-.\nCell already protected: leave U3 Q3 R10 R11 C6 unfitted, bridge JP1.\nFS8205A pinout is vendor-specific (EVVO: 1 S1, 3 S2, 4 G2, 6 G1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "99d36da0-643a-4a59-b879-d71cf1fe6c1f")
	)
	(text "MCU ATtiny85 208-mil SOIC (top)\nR4 47R + C3/C4 filter VCC so LED switching can't reset it.\nFuses: 1 MHz, BOD 2.7 V, RESET enabled.\nPB0 LED1  PB1 LED2  PB2 button  PB3 ~CHRG  PB4 test pad"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "db3a16ac-f170-488f-9266-8b9851a6a353")
	)
	(text "BUTTON (wire pads, bottom)\nMomentary switch between SW and SW_GND.\nR9 limits ESD/ISP fault current, C5 optional."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "def39f68-4b1e-472e-a085-52cbc4e83c09")
	)
	(text "USB-C INPUT (top)\nPower-only, 5.1k on each CC = sink.\nWithout R1/R2, C-to-C chargers give no 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "def5edf2-6c6b-47f6-8c59-085cbe9aa50b")
	)
